<testgrp id="RM000001LYP013X_08_0167" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CIT00001">
<testtitle>Perform Problem Reproduction Test</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Apply vibration by lightly shaking the connectors and harnesses of the V bus No.2 related parts, and inspect the harnesses and connectors of any part where the DTC is output again due to the vibration.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.28in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.85in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC is output regardless of vibration applied to related parts.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
